  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: village in Naulochos area</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient settlement, described by Strabo as lying \"on the left of the Pontus, between Naulochus and Odessos, near Mount Haimos\". Its modern location is uncertain, although it may correspond to a fortified settlement on the St. Athanasius Cape near modern Byala in Bulgaria.",
